# WazHack/ZX 6x8 font, THIN variant (round 6, user: thinner, slight script flavour) — DRAFT.
# ASCII 32-127. Format: '=== <code> <char>' + 8 rows of 6 ('#' ink, '.' paper). Row 0 = line
# gap; caps rows 1-6 (baseline 6), lowercase x-height rows 3-6, descenders row 7; column 5 =
# 1-px letter gap. 1-px strokes, rounded corners; script flavour = exit tails on a d h k n u,
# hooked f/j/t/l, slashed zero (0 vs O), flagged 1 vs serifed I vs tailed l.
# Packed by tools/font_tool.py: 8 B/char, MSB-left, bits 7..2 used (768 B).

